</span></div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Teacher Network (<math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi_{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{T}</annotation></semantics></math>):</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The teacher network is a frozen, pre-trained Sonata model <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#biba.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wu et al., 2025</a>)</cite>, a 3D self-supervised model built upon the Point Transformer V3 (PTv3) architecture. We employ this model for its high-quality, 3D-native representations, which serve as the source of stable geometric priors for distillation. The efficacy of these features is demonstrated on the ScanNet benchmark, where they achieve 72.5% mIoU with linear probing, substantially outperforming 2D-lifted features from models like DINOv2 (63.1% mIoU). The original publication further substantiates the robustness of Sonata’s features through qualitative analyses that show clear semantic clustering and strong spatial reasoning. We use the officially released checkpoint and refer readers to the original work for complete architectural details.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">2D Semantic Backbone (<math id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Psi_{2D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Ψ</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Psi_{2D}</annotation></semantics></math>):</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The 2D semantic backbone provides initial semantic priors using a frozen, pre-trained X-Decoder with a DaViT-L backbone <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#biba.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zou et al., 2023</a>)</cite>, for which we use the officially released weights. X-Decoder is a general-purpose model trained on diverse tasks (e.g., segmentation, image-text retrieval) to learn a unified visual-linguistic embedding space. We hypothesize that features learned via this multi-modal, multi-task objective provide richer semantic information for 3D scene understanding than those from networks trained solely on a single task like segmentation.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Dataset Details and Subset Selection</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For all experiments, we adhere to the official training, validation, and testing splits for the ScanNetV2 and Matterport3D datasets to ensure fair comparison with prior work.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Principled Scene Subset Selection</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> Full set of regions <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math>, desired subset size <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{subset}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{subset}</annotation></semantics></math>, number of clusters <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{clusters}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{clusters}</annotation></semantics></math>, richness weight <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> Selected optimal subset of regions <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{selected}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{selected}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
            
</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Phase 1: Metric Calculation</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
              
              
            Let <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="StatsList\leftarrow[]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">StatsList\leftarrow[]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each region <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\in\mathcal{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\in\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
              Extract semantic labels <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐥</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{l}</annotation></semantics></math> from <math id="alg1.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{c}(r)\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{c}(r)\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Count of unique labels in <math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐥</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{l}</annotation></semantics></math>. <span id="alg1.l8.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Semantic Richness
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(c)\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(c)\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Proportion of each label <math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="alg1.l9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐥</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{l}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="H_{c}(r)\leftarrow-\sum_{c}p(c)\log_{2}p(c)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.055em">−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{c}(r)\leftarrow-\sum_{c}p(c)\log_{2}p(c)</annotation></semantics></math>. <span id="alg1.l10.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Semantic Complexity (Entropy)
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Hist(r)\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Hist(r)\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Full histogram of labels in <math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐥</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{l}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
              
              
              Append <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{r,N_{c}(r),H_{c}(r),Hist(r)\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{r,N_{c}(r),H_{c}(r),Hist(r)\}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="StatsList" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">StatsList</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
              
              
            
</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Phase 2: Filtering</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l16.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\tilde{N}_{c}\leftarrow\text{Median}(\{s.N_{c}\text{ for }s\in StatsList\})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>N</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext>Median</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mtext> for </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{N}_{c}\leftarrow\text{Median}(\{s.N_{c}\text{ for }s\in StatsList\})</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l17.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\tilde{H}_{c}\leftarrow\text{Median}(\{s.H_{c}\text{ for }s\in StatsList\})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext>Median</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mtext> for </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{H}_{c}\leftarrow\text{Median}(\{s.H_{c}\text{ for }s\in StatsList\})</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
              
              
            Let <math id="alg1.l18.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="FilteredList\leftarrow[s\text{ for }s\in StatsList\text{ if }s.N_{c}\geq\tilde{N}_{c}\text{ and }s.H_{c}\geq\tilde{H}_{c}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mtext> for </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext> if </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>N</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mtext> and </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">FilteredList\leftarrow[s\text{ for }s\in StatsList\text{ if }s.N_{c}\geq\tilde{N}_{c}\text{ and }s.H_{c}\geq\tilde{H}_{c}]</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">19:</span>
              
              
            
</div>
<div id="alg1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Phase 3: Clustering</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l21.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="F\leftarrow[s.Hist\text{ for }s\in FilteredList]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext> for </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F\leftarrow[s.Hist\text{ for }s\in FilteredList]</annotation></semantics></math>. <span id="alg1.l21.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l21.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Create feature matrix from histograms
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">22:</span>
              
              
            ClusterLabels <math id="alg1.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow\text{KMeans}(F,K_{clusters})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>KMeans</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow\text{KMeans}(F,K_{clusters})</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l23" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">23:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l23.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\leftarrow 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\leftarrow 1</annotation></semantics></math> to length(<math id="alg1.l23.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="FilteredList" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">FilteredList</annotation></semantics></math>) <span id="alg1.l23.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l24" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">24:</span>
              
              
