<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Comprehensive Hyperparameter Table</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To ensure full reproducibility of our experimental results, we provide a comprehensive list of all hyperparameters used for model training, distillation, and inference. Our final configuration is detailed in Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ A.3 Comprehensive Hyperparameter Table ‣ Appendix A Experimental Setup and Implementation Details ‣ GeoPurify: A Data-Efficient Geometric Distillation Framework for Open-Vocabulary 3D Segmentation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Comprehensive list of hyperparameters. All settings are kept consistent across datasets unless otherwise specified.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T7.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T7.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">Hyperparameter</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">Value</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" colspan="2"><span id="A1.T7.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Training Parameters</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Optimizer</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">AdamW</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Base Learning Rate (<math id="A1.T7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{lr}_{\text{base}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext>lr</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{lr}_{\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">1e-4</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Learning Rate Scaling</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Input layer: <math id="A1.T7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.1\times\text{lr}_{\text{base}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mtext>lr</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.1\times\text{lr}_{\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.6.1" class="ltx_td"></td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Middle layers: <math id="A1.T7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1.0\times\text{lr}_{\text{base}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.0</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mtext>lr</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.0\times\text{lr}_{\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.7.1" class="ltx_td"></td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Output layer: <math id="A1.T7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5.0\times\text{lr}_{\text{base}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>5.0</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mtext>lr</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5.0\times\text{lr}_{\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">LR Scheduler</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Cosine Annealing with Linear Warmup</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Warmup Epochs</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">2</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Warmup Start Factor</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">1e-6</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Cosine Annealing Min LR (<math id="A1.T7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{\text{min}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>min</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{\text{min}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">1e-7 (<math id="A1.T7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10^{-3}\times\text{lr}_{\text{base}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mtext>lr</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{-3}\times\text{lr}_{\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Weight Decay</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">1e-5</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Total Epochs</td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">50</td></tr>
